---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../config";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" canonicalPath="/en/" title="Your LoL rank on Discord" description="Moon Poro is the bot of the League of Legends PL Discord server. Sign in with Riot and get a role with your region and Solo/Duo rank.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1>Show your rank on the server</h1>
      <p class="lead">Moon Poro is the bot of the League of Legends PL server. Sign in with Riot and the bot gives you a role with your region and Solo/Duo rank. It keeps it up to date when you climb.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href={siteConfig.discordInviteUrl}>Join the server</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="#how">How to verify</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="moon"></div>
      <img class="poro" src="/moon-poro.png" alt="" width="128" height="128" />
      <span class="sparkle one"></span>
      <span class="sparkle two"></span>
      <span class="sparkle three"></span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="how">
    <h2>How to verify</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>
        <h3>Click “Zweryfikuj konto”</h3>
        <p>That's “Verify account”, under the verification panel on the server. The bot sends you a private link.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Open the link</h3>
        <p>Click “Zaloguj się przez Riot” (“Sign in with Riot”), then “Przejdź do logowania Riot”. The link works once and only for a few minutes.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Sign in with Riot</h3>
        <p>You sign in on the Riot Games website, the same way as in the game client. Riot shares your Riot ID and region with us.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Done</h3>
        <p>Go back to Discord. You now have the “Zweryfikowany” (Verified) role plus region and rank roles.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>After verifying</h2>
    <ul class="features">
      <li>
        <p class="feature-key"><span class="discord-button grey">Moje konto</span> <span class="or">or</span> <code>/profil</code></p>
        <p>“My account” shows your linked Riot account, rank, LP and win/loss record. Only you can see it.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="feature-key"><span class="discord-button blurple">Odśwież rangę</span></p>
        <p>Your rank refreshes on its own. After a promotion you don't have to wait: click “Refresh rank” in “Moje konto”.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="feature-key"><span class="discord-button red">Usuń powiązanie</span> <span class="or">or</span> <code>/usun_weryfikacje</code></p>
        <p>“Remove link” disconnects your Riot account and removes the Verified role. Region and rank roles stay.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="callout">
      <img src="/moon-poro.png" alt="" width="72" height="72" />
      <div>
        <h2>Your password goes to Riot only</h2>
        <p>You sign in on riotgames.com. Moon Poro never sees your password, and the bot will never ask for it on Discord. Poros prefer Poro-Snax. If someone asks for your password “on behalf of Moon Poro”, it's a scam. Report it to the moderators.</p>
        <p>We only store what's needed for roles: your Discord ID, Riot ID, region and rank. Details are in the <a href="/en/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <div class="faq">
      <details>
        <summary>The link doesn't work or has expired</summary>
        <p>Each link works once and only for a few minutes. Click “Zweryfikuj konto” again and the bot sends a new one.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>I don't play on EUNE</summary>
        <p>You can link an account from EUNE, EUW or NA. Other regions aren't supported yet.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>I want to link a different Riot account</summary>
        <p>Remove the current link in “Moje konto” first, then verify the new account. One Riot account can be linked to only one Discord account.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>My rank on Discord is wrong</summary>
        <p>The bot shows the rank from the last refresh. Click “Odśwież rangę” in “Moje konto” and give it a moment.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens if I leave the server?</summary>
        <p>The link stays, and the bot restores your roles when you come back. If you want it removed and you're no longer on the server, email <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
